    {
      "id": "text_1792908641034_1005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 75,
      "y": 3340,
      "width": 1310,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "F-1: Authentication & User Identity",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#0284c7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "text_1792908641034_1006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 75,
      "y": 3375,
      "width": 1310,
      "height": 20,
      "text": "Source: backend/server/Project/Auth & User",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "text_1792908641034_1007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 75,
      "y": 3415,
      "width": 1310,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "• Google OAuth 2.0 รองรับเฉพาะ @lamduan.mfu.ac.th และ @mfu.ac.th\n\n• ระบบ Auto User Provisioning ดึงข้อมูลชื่อ-รูปภาพบันทึกใน MongoDB\n\n• JWT Token Issuance & Bearer Authorization ในทุก API Request\n\n• User Profiles & Dynamic Role Fetching (Admin, Staff, Student)\n\n• Session Expiration & Vuex State Authorization Guard",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "rect_1792908641034_1008",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 3320,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 340,
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "backgroundColor": "#faf5ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "opacity": 100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "text_1792908641034_1009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1495,
      "y": 3340,
      "width": 1310,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "F-2: Form Authoring & Builder Core",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "text_1792908641034_1010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1495,
      "y": 3375,
      "width": 1310,
      "height": 20,
      "text": "Source: backend/server/Project/Form & Questions",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "text_1792908641034_1011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1495,
      "y": 3415,
      "width": 1310,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "• 8 Question Types: Short Text, Paragraph, Multiple Choice, Checkbox, Rating, File Upload, Title, Image\n\n• Skip Logic Engine (กำหนดเงื่อนไขการข้ามข้อแบบ Branching ตามคำตอบ)\n\n• Form Status Control (Draft, Active, Closed) พร้อมระบบตั้งเวลาเปิด-ปิดอัตโนมัติ\n\n• Collaborator Management (กำหนดสิทธิ์ Editor ปรับปรุง หรือ Viewer ดูคำตอบ)\n\n• Duplicate Buffer (โคลนแบบฟอร์มเดิมเพื่อนำกลับมาใช้ใหม่ได้อย่างรวดเร็ว)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0
    },
    {
