    {
      "id": "text_1793118970548_5070",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2900,
      "y": 7162,
      "width": 630,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "NFR-05: Usability & UX Design",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "text_1793118970548_5071",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2910,
      "y": 7218,
      "width": 610,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "• NFR-UX-01: Fully Responsive Design รองรับการตอบผ่าน Smartphone, Tablet, และ Desktop\n\n• NFR-UX-02: Clean Visual Hierarchy ตามมาตรฐาน Impeccable UI Design System\n\n• NFR-UX-03: Client-side Instant Feedback แสดงแจ้งเตือนผลสำเร็จ/ข้อผิดพลาดทันที\n\n• NFR-UX-04: Bicultural Support รองรับเนื้อหาแบบสอบถามภาษาไทยและภาษาอังกฤษ",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0
    },
