      "x": 5070,
      "y": 1432,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 475,
      "text": "• Collection: users (User/models/user.model.js)\n\n- _id: ObjectId  |  firstname: String  | \n    lastname: String\n\n- email: String (@lamduan.mfu.ac.th / @mfu.ac.th)\n\n  - picture: String (Google Avatar URL)\n\n  - role: ObjectId (Ref -> roles._id)\n\n- organization: ObjectId (Ref ->\n    organizations._id)",
