      "x": 8470,
      "y": 1432,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 475,
      "text": "• Collection: responses\n  (Response/models/response.model.js)\n\n- _id: ObjectId  |  form: ObjectId (Ref ->\n    forms._id)\n\n  - responder: ObjectId (Ref -> users._id)\n\n- submit: Boolean (true = ส่งสมบูรณ์, false =\n    บันทึกร่าง)\n\n- answers: [{ question: ObjectId, answer: Mixed\n    (String / Array / FileUrl) }]",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
