      "y": 3292,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 475,
      "text": "• Component Data: managedForms (Array),\n  statusFilter (\"all\"|\"active\"|\"pending\"|\"closed\")\n\n• Modal State: showShareModal (Boolean),\n  showDeleteConfirm (Boolean)\n\n• Selected Form: activeFormId (String),\n  generatedQrDataUrl (String)\n\n• Computed: filteredManageList (กรองตามสิทธิ์\n  Creator หรือ Collaborator)",
