      "width": 460,
      "height": 475,
      "text": "• Collection: forms (Form/models/form.model.js)\n\n- creator: ObjectId (เจ้าของฟอร์ม)  | \n    organization: [ObjectId]\n\n- collaborators: [{ user: ObjectId, type: ObjectId\n    (Editor / Viewer) }]\n\n- questions: [ObjectId] (ลำดับข้อคำถามในแบบฟอร์ม)\n\n  - createdAt: Date  |  updatedAt: Date",
