      "width": 460,
      "height": 475,
      "text": "• Component Data: activeTab (\"questions\" |\n  \"responses\" | \"settings\")\n\n• Form Builder State: formTitle, formDesc,\n  questionList (Array of Question Objects)\n\n• Auto-Save State: isSaving (Boolean),\n  lastSavedTime (Date), debounceTimer\n\n• Collaborator State: inviteEmail (String),\n  collaboratorRole (\"Editor\"|\"Viewer\")",
