      "y": 3292,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 475,
      "text": "• Collection: questions\n  (Questions/models/questions.model.js)\n\n- _id: ObjectId  |  title: [{ key, value }]  | \n    description: [{ key, value }]\n\n- type: ObjectId (Ref -> setting_question_types: 8\n    ชนิด)\n\n  - required: Boolean  |  index: Number (ลำดับข้อ)\n\n- config: { choices: [{ key, value, nextQuestion\n    }], maxRating: Number, fileTypes: Array }",
