      "height": 475,
      "text": "• Joined View: responses + forms + questions +\n  users\n\n  - responder: { firstname, lastname, email }\n\n  - createdAt: Date (วันและเวลาที่กดส่งคำตอบ)\n\n- submit: Boolean  |  answers: [{ questionTitle,\n    questionType, submittedValue }]",
