      "text": "• Collection: roles (User/models/roles.model.js)\n\n  - _id: ObjectId\n\n- title: [{ key: \"en\"|\"th\", value: String }] (เช่น\n    Admin, Staff, Student)\n\n  - description: [{ key, value }]\n\n- permission: [{ pageId: String, read: Boolean,\n    create: Boolean, update: Boolean, delete:\n    Boolean }]",
