    {
      "id": "s8_ui_txt_1234",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4560,
      "y": 7985,
      "width": 1550,
      "height": 22,
      "text": "A. Vue.js Wizard Component & Reactive State (FormBuilderWizard.vue)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#0369a1",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "s8_ui_txt_1235",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4560,
      "y": 8031,
      "width": 1550,
      "height": 435,
      "text": "• คอมโพเนนต์ใหม่: frontend/src/projects/components/Util/FormBuilderWizard.vue (ทำงานร่วมกับ CreateForm.vue, Tab.vue และ Toolbar.vue)\n\n• Wizard Reactive State (data):\n\n  - isWizardActive: Boolean (เปิด/ปิดโหมดผู้ช่วยสอน Step-by-Step)\n\n  - currentStep: Number (1 = ข้อมูลฟอร์ม, 2 = เพิ่มคำถาม, 3 = ตั้งค่า & สิทธิ์, 4 = ตรวจสอบ & แชร์)\n\n  - spotlightTarget: String (\"#wizard-form-header\" | \"#wizard-question-panel\" | \"#wizard-settings-panel\" | \"#wizard-share-panel\")\n\n• Computed Readiness Checklist:\n\n  - step1Valid: Boolean (ตรวจว่า form.title มีค่าและไม่ใช่คำว่า \"Untitled Form\" หรือว่างเปล่า)\n\n  - step2Valid: Boolean (ตรวจว่า form.questions.length >= 1 ข้อขึ้นไป)\n\n  - step3Valid: Boolean (ตรวจการตั้งค่า schedule / settings.limitResponse / organization)",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0
    },
